@startuml
' Sequence: view the sales report - Inventory & POS System v0.18.2 (report, Lecture 5)
' Edit: paste into draw.io (Arrange > Insert > Advanced > PlantUML) or planttext.com
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #333333
skinparam rectangle {
  BackgroundColor White
  BorderColor Black
}
skinparam usecase {
  BackgroundColor White
  BorderColor Black
}
skinparam class {
  BackgroundColor White
  BorderColor Black
  HeaderBackgroundColor #E6F1EE
}
skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor White
  BorderColor Black
}
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor White
  BorderColor Black
}
skinparam sequence {
  ParticipantBackgroundColor White
  ParticipantBorderColor Black
  LifeLineBorderColor #888888
  ActorBorderColor Black
  ActorBackgroundColor White
}
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #FFFBEA
  BorderColor #C9B458
}
skinparam swimlaneWidth same
hide circle

actor Admin
participant "Sales Report page\n(browser)" as UI
participant "sales_report()\n(app.py)" as C
database "Database" as DB
Admin -> UI : opens Sales Report, picks From / To
UI -> C : GET /reports/sales?start=...&end=...
C -> C : admin? dates real and between 2000 and 2100?
C -> DB : sales from start of first day to end of last day
DB --> C : sales with items
C -> C : revenue (cash / GCash), items sold,\ntop 5 products grouped by product
C --> UI : summary cards, top products, all sales
@enduml
